# Magic Box fractal background; attribution is in magic-box.slang. Use only one animated background.

# MBOX_STRENGTH: background blend; MBOX_SPEED: forward speed, 0 for no drift.
# MBOX_GATE: filament threshold; lower values reveal more filaments. Colors and iteration constants are in the shader.

# Keep the texture declaration to avoid changing the texture set when switching backgrounds.
textures a

startgroup
    animation_step 16
    var float MBOX_STRENGTH 0.60
    var float MBOX_SPEED 0.05
    var float MBOX_GATE 0.34
    shaders magic-box
endgroup
